<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglovaal, AVI issue cautionary.</title>
<headline>Anglovaal, AVI issue cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglovaal Ltd and Anglovaal Industries Ltd said on Friday that negotiations were in progress which could have an impact on their share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>The companies gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
